# A Clone that enters as a copy has the copied creature's abilities as it enters, so its "when this creature enters"
# triggers for it (CR 707.2, 603.6a, the card's ruling). On turn 1 Bot1 casts Baleful Strix with two Moxes and draws the
# Plains; then Clone for Black Lotus and the Island, copying the Strix: the Clone is an artifact Bird with flying and
# deathtouch and draws the next card, the Forest. Without the copied trigger the Forest would still be on top.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Baleful Strix
Clone
Swamp
Plains
Forest
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
